<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμι-έκτεων</span></b> , gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εω,
				τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>half</i>-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτεύς</span>, acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εων</span>
			(written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εον</span>) ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.76.7
			</span></i>; gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.1356
			</span></i>; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					643
				</span></i>
			; nom. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				645
			</span></i>, <i>Mémoires présentés
				à l' Acad. des Inscr.</i><i><span class="en">
				1923.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>; written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ειον</span> ibid.; pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1672.15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				268
			</span></i>, al.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμι-έα</span></b>  prob.
			cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				174.12
			</span></i>: 
				Ion.
			 pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εκτῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			. (Accent doubtful, parox. in codd.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ειον, -εια</span> may have short <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ει</span> as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰάν</span>,
		etc.)</div>
